# DRC-ENG-1: top > mid > leaf; paint in the leaf after building; the checkpaint sections of all three before any check.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load leaf
box 0 0 10 10
paint m1
load mid
box 0 0 0 0
getcell leaf
load top
box 100 50 100 50
getcell mid
writeall force
load leaf
box 20 0 30 5
paint m1
writeall force
